# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment variables for DEVAcademy V.1.b
# Copy this file to `.env` and adjust as needed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Backend proxy path.
# The frontend sends all backend requests to this relative path (same-origin),
# e.g. `/backend-api/api/files/...`. Your web server (nginx / Apache / Caddy)
# must reverse-proxy this path to the actual HTTP backend at 103.172.20.26:8081.
#
# During `vite dev`, Vite proxies `/backend-api` → http://103.172.20.26:8081
# automatically (see vite.config.ts → server.proxy).
#
# In production, you configure the proxy on your web server (examples below).
VITE_BACKEND_URL=/backend-api
